@startuml agentic-value-stream-measurement-hierarchy
' Per CR-VAS-005 §5 (Measurement Hierarchy).
' Cardinal author rule: Emmanuel A. Otchere <emmanuel@otchere.com>
' Last revised: 2026-10-08.

title Agentic Value Stream ; Measurement Hierarchy

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false

(*) -> "Level 1 ; Activity\nWhat happened?"

"Level 1 ; Activity\nWhat happened?" --> "Level 2 ; Behavior\nHow did the agent behave?"

"Level 2 ; Behavior\nHow did the agent behave?" --> "Level 3 ; Performance\nHow well did it perform?"

"Level 3 ; Performance\nHow well did it perform?" --> "Level 4 ; Value\nWhat value did it create or protect?"

"Level 4 ; Value\nWhat value did it create or protect?" --> "Level 5 ; Strategic Effect\nWhat changed because of agentic realization?"

"Level 5 ; Strategic Effect\nWhat changed because of agentic realization?" --> (*)

note right
  Prevents dashboards from becoming
  collections of low-level telemetry.

  Per CR-VAS-005 §5.
end note

@enduml
